<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
</head>

<body>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>We've received a request to reset the password for the Virtual Speed Date account associated with {{ user.email
        }}. No changes have been made to your account yet.</p>
    <p>Please find 6 digit PIN below</p>
    <h2>{{ resetCode }}</h2>
    <p>If you did not request a new password, then please ignore this mail.</p>
    <p>-- The {{ appName }} team</p>
</body>

</html>
